    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6007" root="جفو" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُفَآءٌ</span></b>  The <i>rubbish and scum cast forth by the
torrent of a valley,</i> and <i>by a cooking-pot.</i> (Er-Rághib, TA.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جفأ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence,
as being likened to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُفَآء</span> of the torrent, (tropical:) The
<i>first,</i> or <i>foremost,</i> of men, or people. (TA.)
[But see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جفأ</span>.]

